abstract: >-
  IAML is an open-source Python framework for automated machine learning in
  clinical research. It combines preprocessing, model selection, and evaluation
  for classification, regression, and survival analysis on tabular data. Its
  modular architecture supports custom components, while pipeline inspection and
  SHAP explanations help researchers interpret results.
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/IIAS-Research/iaml
url: https://iias-research.github.io/iaml/
